# OnLocalAI UI Design

Shared visual language for **onlocal-public** (marketing) and **Local-LLM** (product app). Match existing brand tokens; do not invent a new palette or look.

## Brand core

- Product name lockup: `onlocal` + `AI` (AI in a lighter brand tint). Mark inherits `currentColor`.
- Primary navy (logo): `#01185E` → Tailwind `brand-900` / CSS `--accent`
- Light UI default. Dark theme only in the product app via existing `data-theme="dark"` tokens — never invent new dark colors.
- Avoid: purple/indigo themes, cream+terracotta, glow stacks, emoji decoration, generic Inter-as-hero marketing fonts when Geist/brand stack is already in use on the marketing site.

## Color tokens (keep in sync)

| Role | Marketing (Tailwind) | Product (CSS vars, light) |
|------|----------------------|---------------------------|
| Accent / navy | `brand-900` `#01185E` | `--accent` `#01185E` |
| Stronger navy | `brand-950` `#030f3a` | `--accent-strong` `#001046` |
| Soft fill | `brand-50` / `brand-100` | `--accent-soft` |
| Text | `slate-900` / `slate-700` | `--text` / `--text-2` |
| Muted | `slate-500` / `slate-600` | `--muted` |
| Surface | white / `slate-50` | `--surface` / `--bg` `#f4f5fb` |
| Border | `slate-200` | `--border` `#e3e6f3` |
| Sidebar | n/a (marketing) | navy gradient `#01185e` → `#000d38` |

Semantic: ok `#0ea672`, warn `#d98700`, err `#e0384e` (product). Prefer brand navy over sky/blue-500 for CTAs.

## Layout & components

- **Marketing**: white page, soft brand/sky ambient blurs, sticky glass header, `max-w-6xl`, `rounded-2xl` cards, primary CTA `bg-brand-900` → hover `brand-800`.
- **Product app**: reuse `:root` / `html[data-theme="dark"]` variables in `app/static/index.html` — radii `--radius` / `--radius-lg`, existing shadows, sidebar gradient. Do not restyle chrome with one-off hex.
- Radius: prefer `rounded-xl` / `rounded-2xl` (marketing) or `var(--radius*)` (app). Avoid `rounded-full` pills except small status dots.
- Motion: subtle only (`fade-up`, soft float, pulse-dot). Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Do / Don't

```tsx
// ✅ Primary CTA
className="rounded-xl bg-brand-900 text-white hover:bg-brand-800"

// ❌ Off-brand
className="rounded-full bg-violet-600 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(139,92,246,.5)]"
```

When changing colors or logo treatment in one repo, mirror the same tokens/wordmark in the other.
